{"title":"我会副会长单位广东省监理斩获代理行业国家级称号 本地化战略再结硕果","date":"2025-08-05","content":"<section class=\"article135\" data-role=\"outer\" label=\"edit by 135editor\">\r\n\t<section data-color=\"#1e9be8\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; height: 0px;\">\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t<h1 class=\"rich_media_title\" id=\"activity-name\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.4; user-select: text; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: center; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n\t\t<strong>我会副会长单位广东省监理斩获代理行业国家级称号 本地化战略再结硕果</strong></h1>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t<section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-role=\"outer\" label=\"edit by 135editor\">\r\n\t\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"162570\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;padding: 0 5px 0 20px;margin-bottom: 6px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 40px;z-index: 3;margin-bottom: -30px;margin-left: -20px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding:  15px 0;border-top: 1px  solid #0e65d2;border-bottom: 1px  solid #0e65d2;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-autoskip=\"1\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-size: 17px; background-color: transparent;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 2.17647em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t近日，广东省监理喜讯频传，凭借在招标代理领域的卓越表现，连续斩获多项国家级、省级权威荣誉，并实现汕尾本地化运营战略突破，彰显企业综合实力与行业影响力。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section data-role=\"paragraph\">\r\n\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"161893\" data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;display: flex;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink: 0;padding-right: 5px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 10px;height: 100%;background: linear-gradient(to bottom,#67e5d5,#ffffff);box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;max-width:100% !important;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"border: 1px solid #0e65d2;padding: 3px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right,#e2eeff,#ffffff);padding: 5px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-between;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;max-width:100% !important;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 19px; color: rgb(19, 92, 183);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong data-brushtype=\"text\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">行业盛典连获四项大奖&nbsp;</strong><strong style=\"background-color: initial;caret-color: red;\">实力获权威认证</strong></strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding-left: 15px;box-sizing:border-box;flex-shrink: 0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 16px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section data-role=\"paragraph\">\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.75em; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t在由中国采购与招标网、中国名企排行网联合主办的&ldquo;招标代理行业发展45周年纪念&rdquo;盛典中，广东省监理以亮眼表现赢得行业高度认可，一举摘得四项重量级荣誉：2025国有招标代理机构30强、2025EPC项目招标代理机构10强、招投标行业发展45年●招标代理五星级优质服务奖（★★★★★）、招标代理行业发展45周年●行业领军企业。</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.75em; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t团队建设亦成果斐然，1人获评&ldquo;优秀职业经理人&rdquo;，17人荣获&ldquo;优秀招标师&rdquo;称号，充分印证企业人才实力与专业竞争力。</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.75em; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t作为上榜企业，广东省监理已获邀出席&ldquo;重点领域投融资研讨会暨第六届全过程工程咨询大会&rdquo;，将借此平台深化行业交流、拓展合作机遇。</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; text-indent: 0em; line-height: 1.75em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"161893\" data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;display: flex;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink: 0;padding-right: 5px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 10px;height: 100%;background: linear-gradient(to bottom,#67e5d5,#ffffff);box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;max-width:100% !important;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"border: 1px solid #0e65d2;padding: 3px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right,#e2eeff,#ffffff);padding: 5px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-between;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;max-width:100% !important;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 19px; color: rgb(19, 92, 183);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong data-brushtype=\"text\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">信用建设再获&ldquo;双料&rdquo;认证&nbsp;</strong><strong style=\"background-color: initial;caret-color: red;\">诚信基因深入于心</strong></strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding-left: 15px;box-sizing:border-box;flex-shrink: 0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 16px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.75em; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t广东省监理长期坚守诚信经营理念，近日在广东省公共资源交易联合会发布的《2024年度会员信用评价结果》中，同时斩获&ldquo;交易项目响应方&rdquo;与&ldquo;中介服务机构&rdquo;两大业务类别的&ldquo;信用优秀单位（AAA级）&rdquo;称号，实现信用实力双重背书。</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.75em; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t广东省监理始终将诚信视为生存发展生命线，通过持续深化信用体系建设，紧跟政策法规与行业标准，优化内部信用管理机制；严守法规与专业准则，确保服务经得起法律与市场检验；提升服务效能与温度，兼顾专业严谨与人性化体验。</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; text-indent: 0em; line-height: 1.75em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"161893\" data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;display: flex;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink: 0;padding-right: 5px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 10px;height: 100%;background: linear-gradient(to bottom,#67e5d5,#ffffff);box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;max-width:100% !important;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"border: 1px solid #0e65d2;padding: 3px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right,#e2eeff,#ffffff);padding: 5px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-between;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;max-width:100% !important;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 19px; color: rgb(19, 92, 183);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong data-brushtype=\"text\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">汕尾本地化运营突破&nbsp;</strong><strong style=\"background-color: initial;caret-color: red;\">助力区域高质量发展</strong></strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding-left: 15px;box-sizing:border-box;flex-shrink: 0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 16px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.75em; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t在汕尾市代建项目事务中心公布的&ldquo;建设项目工程招标代理机构批量采购入围结果&rdquo;中，广东省监理凭借深厚行业积淀与本地化深耕优势成功入围，标志着其区域战略落地取得实质性进展。</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.75em; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t下一步，广东省监理将深度融入广东省&ldquo;百县千镇万村高质量发展工程&rdquo;，以专业力量赋能汕尾建设，持续深化本地化优势，助力汕尾市高质量发展。</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t此次系列荣誉是广东省监理长期坚持专业化、规范化、诚信化发展的里程碑，更是新起点。广东省监理将以&ldquo;双优&rdquo;认证为鞭策，持续深化信用体系、严守专业标准、提升服务温度，在招标代理与全过程工程咨询领域书写新篇章。</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>"}